# API keys are stored encrypted as api_keys.env.enc (AES-256-GCM).
# It can hold OPENROUTER_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY,
# OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, or GEMINI_API_KEY.
# Run SETUP.bat to choose a provider, save your key, and choose a passphrase.
# The passphrase is never stored in this folder.
